  ('legacy:600',600,'Lowest upper-secondary out-of-school rate','UNESCO UIS','Education · ROFST.MOD.3','verified','94','advance_to_validation','clear_generic_legacy_block','broad_intuitive_distinct','Out-of-school rates are intuitive, globally meaningful education-access measures; primary and upper-secondary provide meaningfully different stages without keeping every adjacent stage.','Validate the UNESCO UIS source-family rows and retain only these stage anchors unless later playtesting supports more.','family:unesco:lowest-upper-secondary-out-of-school','ready_for_source_family_validation'),
  ('legacy:601',601,'Lowest lower-secondary out-of-school rate','UNESCO UIS','Education · ROFST.MOD.2','verified','94','retain_exclusion','confirm_reasoned_exclusion','family_density_near_duplicate_v16_2_6_final_curation','Plausible in isolation, but too close to a stronger retained stage/subject/infrastructure anchor or part of an over-dense education family; needs family-level curation before any legacy block is cleared. Final v16.2.6 curation decision: this concept is not selected for the playable core, so there is no reason to leave its legacy state unresolved.','Keep excluded for v16.2.6. A future release may explicitly reopen it, but the historical rejection is now backed by this current editorial curation decision.','family:unesco:lowest-lower-secondary-out-of-school','ready_for_source_family_validation'),
