  ('legacy:795',795,'Highest urban population share','World Bank','Population · SP.URB.TOTL.IN.ZS','verified','90','retain_exclusion','confirm_reasoned_exclusion','definition_overlap_v16_2_6_final_curation','“Urban” is definition-sensitive and the new WUP family distinguishes cities, towns and rural areas; this old aggregate wording risks mixing a different urbanization concept with the newer taxonomy. Final v16.2.6 curation decision: this concept is not selected for the playable core, so there is no reason to leave its legacy state unresolved.','Keep excluded for v16.2.6. A future release may explicitly reopen it, but the historical rejection is now backed by this current editorial curation decision.','',''),
