  ('legacy:1288',1288,'Highest carbon dioxide (CO2) net fluxes from LULUCF - Deforestation','World Bank','Environment · EN.GHG.CO2.LU.DF.MT.CE.AR5','verified','79','retain_exclusion','confirm_reasoned_exclusion','emissions_overproliferation','This is part of the previously overgrown emissions matrix (gas/sector/LULUCF variants). Even when technically valid, it is too repetitive or specialized relative to a small set of broad emissions anchors.','Keep excluded; any future emissions expansion must demonstrate a genuinely new player-facing concept rather than another gas/sector slice.','',''),
