  ('legacy:1357',1357,'Highest secondary-school enrollment','UNESCO UIS','Education · GER.2T3','verified','77','retain_exclusion','confirm_reasoned_exclusion','family_density_near_duplicate_v16_2_6_final_curation','Plausible in isolation, but too close to a stronger retained stage/subject/infrastructure anchor or part of an over-dense education family; needs family-level curation before any legacy block is cleared. Final v16.2.6 curation decision: this concept is not selected for the playable core, so there is no reason to leave its legacy state unresolved.','Keep excluded for v16.2.6. A future release may explicitly reopen it, but the historical rejection is now backed by this current editorial curation decision.','family:unesco:highest-secondary-enrollment','ready_for_source_family_validation'),
